ns. Container, field and expression receivers are outside this profile. Real rustc still decides whether the requested target conversion exists. Normal as casts remain available.<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n{\n  \"edits\": [\n    {\n      \"changes\": {\n        \"text\": \"buf[0] = x.wrapping_add(1)\"\n      },\n      \"node\": \"api.rs/touch/n4\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"changes\": {\n        \"text\": \"buf[0] = x.wrapping_add(1)\"\n      },\n      \"node\": \"api.rs/touch/n21\"\n    }\n  ]\n}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\nThe previous submission was rejected; the project's original source has NOT changed. This includes a candidate that compiled but returned wrong public values or resources. Recheck all stated requirements, type widths and owner lifetime. Return a new COMPLETE response in the same interface. For node edits, use the SAME original query and resubmit the ENTIRE required edit set, not an increment on the rejected candidate. No previous edits are retained or automatically merged. Only public observations have run.\n{\"after_revision\":\"55347701196d09ff76520157159cb3c4c219d1593ef2cf531500bbd9d76a8f41\",\"before_revision\":\"55347701196d09ff76520157159cb3c4c219d1593ef2cf531500bbd9d76a8f41\",\"build_status\":\"response_rejected\",\"diagnostic\":\"{\\\"message\\\":\\\"E_STRUCTURED_EDIT: duplicate, unknown or unauthorized node\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"EditRejected\\\"}\",\"diagnostic_clipped\":false,\"diagnostic_original_characters\":94,\"diagnostic_original_sha256\":\"c1a086cfa1f1922e6ffb0249ba2b2f586a506ccc86be10e173d75505bab0830e\",\"project_source_updated\":false,\"public_argument_order\":[\"a\",\"b\",\"c\"],\"public_cases\":[]}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n","has_new_line":true,"truncated":false,"stop_type":"eos","stopping_word":"","tokens_cached":2807,"timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":2716,"prompt_ms":58930.217,"prompt_per_token_ms":21.697428939617083,"prompt_per_second":46.08840995783199,"predicted_n":92,"predicted_ms":27801.398,"predicted_per